From feb39b3988f38f88a3bad07a292c570ee57a15ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gokwok <531504879@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 23:05:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] vmm: Prepare an empty KVM VM on explicit request

Add vmm.prepare for idle VMMs and transfer the empty VM into restore.
Do not change ordinary VMM startup or prepare confidential VM types.
Delete drops idle resources; other backends retain ordinary creation.
This is an experimental API requiring upstream lifecycle review.

Match the KVM VM type rather than unrelated nested/SMT/RAM fields.

Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-6
Signed-off-by: gokwok <531504879@qq.com>
