+# Idle VMM preparation
+
+Preparation is optional. Starting a VMM and the ordinary create/restore APIs
+retain their existing behavior. `PUT /api/v1/vmm.prepare` with `{}` creates
+an empty default KVM VM without guest memory, devices or guest execution.
+A subsequent ordinary restore consumes it. Confidential VM types use the
+ordinary constructor instead. Other hypervisor backends reject preparation.
+
+Preparation is single-use. A repeated request is rejected. Delete discards
+unused preparation; after a failed preparation, replace the VMM process.
+These interfaces are proposed extensions, not upstream compatibility promises.
